 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. LONGNM.
* names to thirty characters (2026-11-11).  The two
* balances agree in their first 16 letters and were
* one name (a duplicate) when ten counted.  Expect
*   L1 0000100 0000200 0000300
*   L2 YES
*   L3 DONE
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 77  CUSTOMER-BALANCE-1  PIC 9(7) VALUE 100.
 77  CUSTOMER-BALANCE-2  PIC 9(7) VALUE 200.
 77  A-NAME-OF-EXACTLY-THIRTY-CHARS PIC 9(7).
 01  ACCOUNT-STATUS-INDICATOR-FLAG PIC X VALUE "Y".
     88  ACCOUNT-IS-IN-GOOD-STANDING VALUE "Y".
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     ADD CUSTOMER-BALANCE-1 CUSTOMER-BALANCE-2
         GIVING A-NAME-OF-EXACTLY-THIRTY-CHARS.
     DISPLAY "L1 " CUSTOMER-BALANCE-1 " " CUSTOMER-BALANCE-2 " "
         A-NAME-OF-EXACTLY-THIRTY-CHARS.
     IF ACCOUNT-IS-IN-GOOD-STANDING DISPLAY "L2 YES".
     PERFORM A-PARAGRAPH-WITH-A-LONG-NAME.
     STOP RUN.
 A-PARAGRAPH-WITH-A-LONG-NAME.
     DISPLAY "L3 DONE".
